---
functor: 1
title: Functions and spaces
---

set heading(numbering: none)

A function name is set upright. It takes no operations.

# Functions

| Name | Result | Limits in display |
|:--|:-:|:--|
| `sin` | $sin x$ | at the side |
| `cos` | $cos x$ | at the side |
| `tan` | $tan x$ | at the side |
| `log` | $log x$ | at the side |
| `ln` | $ln x$ | at the side |
| `exp` | $exp x$ | at the side |
| `det` | $det x$ | below |
| `dim` | $dim x$ | at the side |
| `ker` | $ker x$ | at the side |
| `deg` | $deg x$ | at the side |
| `gcd` | $gcd x$ | below |
| `arg` | $arg x$ | at the side |
| `lim` | $lim x$ | below |
| `max` | $max x$ | below |
| `min` | $min x$ | below |
| `sup` | $sup x$ | below |
| `inf` | $inf x$ | below |
| `sinh` | $sinh x$ | at the side |
| `cosh` | $cosh x$ | at the side |
| `tanh` | $tanh x$ | at the side |
| `coth` | $coth x$ | at the side |
| `sec` | $sec x$ | at the side |
| `csc` | $csc x$ | at the side |
| `cot` | $cot x$ | at the side |
| `arcsin` | $arcsin x$ | at the side |
| `arccos` | $arccos x$ | at the side |
| `arctan` | $arctan x$ | at the side |
| `lg` | $lg x$ | at the side |
| `limsup` | $limsup x$ | below |
| `liminf` | $liminf x$ | below |
| `argmax` | $argmax x$ | below |
| `argmin` | $argmin x$ | below |
| `colim` | $colim x$ | below |
| `rank` | $rank x$ | at the side |
| `tr` | $tr x$ | at the side |
| `Tr` | $Tr x$ | at the side |
| `sgn` | $sgn x$ | at the side |
| `lcm` | $lcm x$ | below |
| `span` | $span x$ | at the side |
| `diag` | $diag x$ | at the side |
| `id` | $id x$ | at the side |
| `im` | $im x$ | at the side |
| `coker` | $coker x$ | at the side |
| `Aut` | $Aut x$ | at the side |
| `End` | $End x$ | at the side |
| `Hom` | $Hom x$ | at the side |
| `Ext` | $Ext x$ | at the side |
| `Tor` | $Tor x$ | at the side |
| `Spec` | $Spec x$ | at the side |
| `Gal` | $Gal x$ | at the side |
| `Re` | $Re x$ | at the side |
| `Im` | $Im x$ | at the side |
| `supp` | $supp x$ | at the side |
| `vol` | $vol x$ | at the side |
| `erf` | $erf x$ | at the side |
| `res` | $res x$ | at the side |
| `Pr` | $Pr x$ | below |
| `Var` | $Var x$ | at the side |
| `Cov` | $Cov x$ | at the side |
| `Corr` | $Corr x$ | at the side |
| `grad` | $grad x$ | at the side |
| `curl` | $curl x$ | at the side |
| `mod` | $mod x$ | at the side |

For another upright name, write text in quotes: `"tr" A`.

# Spaces

| Name | Width | Example |
|:--|:--|:-:|
| `neg` | -0.083 em | $a neg b$ |
| `thin` | 0.167 em | $a thin b$ |
| `med` | 0.222 em | $a med b$ |
| `thick` | 0.278 em | $a thick b$ |
| `quad` | 1.000 em | $a quad b$ |
| `qquad` | 2.000 em | $a qquad b$ |
